  "translation": "Gomme o tla ba re: Go bolela Yahwe Tsebaote, Elohim wa Yisraele: Nwang, nwa go feta, hlakanela, gomme wa wa, gomme le se ke la tšoga, ka baka la tšhoša yeo ke e romelago gare ga lona.",
